  "deletedAt": null,
  "deletedBy": null,
  "details": "I have some versions of my (PC) avatar that I also uploaded quest versions for. I would like to delete the quest uploads only. As far as I can tell this is not currently possible. \n\nFor worlds you can go on the VRC Home website and see which platforms the world is uploaded to and delete each platform separately. There is no such information or methods like this for avatars, so it is difficult to manage.",
